function filterPopup(button,key,event){const v=current();const values=key==='rating'?freshFilters().rating:key==='media'?freshFilters().media:['Newest','Oldest','Highest score','Random'];openPopup(button,`<h3>${key==='sort'?'Sorting':key==='media'?'Media type':'Rating'}</h3>`+values.map(x=>`<label><input type="${key==='sort'?'radio':'checkbox'}" name="${key}" value="${x}" ${key==='sort'?v.draftFilters.sort===x?'checked':'':v.draftFilters[key].includes(x)?'checked':''}>${x}</label>`).join(''),()=>$$('#popup input').forEach(input=>input.onchange=()=>{if(key==='sort')v.draftFilters.sort=input.value;else{v.draftFilters[key]=values.filter(x=>[...$('#popup').querySelectorAll('input:checked')].some(i=>i.value===x));if(!v.draftFilters[key].length){v.draftFilters[key]=[...values];$$('#popup input').forEach(i=>i.checked=true)}}const display=key==='sort'?v.draftFilters.sort:v.draftFilters[key].join(', ');button.title=display;const chosen=key==='sort'?(display==='Random'?'shuffle':display==='Oldest'?'up':display==='Highest score'?'star':'sort'):key==='media'&&v.draftFilters.media.length===1?(v.draftFilters.media[0]==='Videos'?'film':v.draftFilters.media[0]==='Animated images'?'animate':'image'):key==='rating'?'rating':'image';button.innerHTML=icon(chosen)+(key!=='sort'&&v.draftFilters[key].length>1?'<span class="badge">'+v.draftFilters[key].length+'</span>':'');updateDirty();persist()}));if(!$('#popup').hidden&&popupAnchor===button){const rect=button.getBoundingClientRect();const center=rect.left+rect.width/2;const width=$('#popup').offsetWidth;$('#popup').style.left=Math.max(12,Math.min(rect.left,innerWidth-width-12))+'px';if(!matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches){const popup=$('#popup');popup.getAnimations().forEach(animation=>animation.cancel());popup.style.transformOrigin=`${Math.max(0,Math.min(width,center-parseFloat(popup.style.left)))}px top`;popup.animate([{opacity:0,transform:'translateY(-4px) scale(.97)'},{opacity:1,transform:'translateY(0) scale(1)'}],{duration:150,easing:'cubic-bezier(.2,.75,.25,1)'})}}}
function showSuggestions(){clearTimeout(queryTimer);queryTimer=setTimeout(()=>{const input=$('#query');if(!input)return;const before=input.value.slice(0,input.selectionStart),token=before.split(/\s/).pop().replace(/^-/,'');if(!token){suggestions=[];closePopup();return}suggestions=tags.filter(t=>t[0].includes(token)).slice(0,7);suggestIndex=-1;renderSuggestions()},100)}
function renderSuggestions(){if(!suggestions.length)return closePopup();openPopup($('#query'),suggestions.map(([t,c],i)=>`<button class="menu-item suggestion ${i===suggestIndex?'active':''}" data-suggestion="${i}"><span class="${c}">${t.replaceAll('_',' ')}</span><small>${(t.length*731).toLocaleString()}</small></button>`).join(''),()=>$$('[data-suggestion]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=e=>{e.stopPropagation();insertSuggestion(suggestions[+b.dataset.suggestion])}),'suggestions')}
function insertSuggestion(s){if(!s)return;const input=$('#query'),v=current(),pos=input.selectionStart,start=input.value.slice(0,pos).search(/\S*$/),end=pos+(input.value.slice(pos).match(/^\S*/)||[''])[0].length,negative=input.value[start]==='-';v.draft=input.value.slice(0,start)+(negative?'-':'')+s[0]+' '+input.value.slice(end).replace(/^ /,'');const caret=start+(negative?1:0)+s[0].length+1;input.value=v.draft;closePopup();input.focus();input.setSelectionRange(caret,caret);updateDirty()}
function saveLabel(v){const ts=v.q.trim().split(/\s+/);return ts.length===1&&category(ts[0])==='artist'?'Save artist':ts.length===1&&category(ts[0])==='character'?'Save character':'Save search'}
function savedType(saved){return saved.type||saveLabel(saved).replace('Save ','').replace(/^./,c=>c.toUpperCase())}
function changeSavedType(saved){showDialog(`<h2>Saved search type</h2><div class="type-choices">${['Search','Artist','Character'].map(type=>`<label><input type="radio" name="saved-type" value="${type}" ${savedType(saved)===type?'checked':''}> ${type}</label>`).join('')}</div><div class="dialog-actions"><button value="cancel">Cancel</button><button type="button" class="primary" id="save-search-type">Save</button></div>`);$('#save-search-type').onclick=()=>{saved.type=$('#dialog input[name="saved-type"]:checked').value;$('#dialog').close();render();persist()}}
